  "description": "Compress JPEG, PNG, GIF (animated too), WebP, BMP, TIFF, TGA, PNM and QOI images toward a target file size with zero dependencies (own codecs, including progressive and CMYK JPEG, lossy and lossless WebP): resize to a box, crop, rotate, mirror, ICC-to-sRGB colour conversion, optional EXIF/ICC preservation, EXIF auto-orient, and alpha-aware JPEG/PNG output.",
